{"status":"completed","summary":"Inventory application is available on node1 at TCP/8181 with SELinux Enforcing. Configuration persisted across the required reboot; OS release and kernel remain unchanged.","actions_performed":["Installed AlmaLinux-supported Apache and SELinux port-management packages.","Configured Apache to listen on TCP/8181 and created the inventory application page.","Assigned TCP/8181 to SELinux type http_port_t.","Opened TCP/8181 in runtime and persistent firewalld configuration.","Enabled httpd at boot and verified HTTP 200 using node1's managed IP.","Restarted node1 once and verified complete recovery with a changed boot identity."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Serve the inventory application over TCP/8181","command_ids":["cmd-d537f2cf088e4c8a","cmd-c1b0eaad822e4f1f","cmd-cd461e01101d47a4"],"summary":"Apache listens on 8181 and returns HTTP 200 with the Inventory Application content before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"Keep mandatory access control enforcing","command_ids":["cmd-81ce9350be8c4fa0","cmd-c1b0eaad822e4f1f","cmd-cd461e01101d47a4"],"summary":"SELinux remained Enforcing; TCP/8181 is labeled http_port_t and content is labeled httpd_sys_content_t."},{"requirement":"Preserve installed OS release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-237964f62e4a4054","cmd-c1b0eaad822e4f1f","cmd-cd461e01101d47a4"],"summary":"AlmaLinux 9.6 and kernel 5.14.0-570.12.1.el9_6.x86_64 are unchanged."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c1b0eaad822e4f1f","cmd-52cafaa5544e4196","cmd-769c80de48944abf","cmd-7421092098f34462","cmd-cd461e01101d47a4"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 15443601-befc-4fc4-aa76-b417968ad3f9 was captured, reboot was acknowledged, the management connection reset during restart, and node1 returned with changed boot ID 839b481a-5a0d-492e-8c59-f14092b424cc. The system, Apache, inventory content, SELinux policy, firewall rules, and listener all recovered with zero failed units."}]}
